1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,666
地图上，这里还是一片海。
On the map, this is still a sea.

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,690
1977 年，它确实是。
In 1977, it was.

3
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:13,590
后来，河水被引去种棉花。
Then its rivers went to the cotton fields.

4
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:16,860
到 2014 年，东边的湖盆干涸了。
By 2014, the eastern basin had dried.

5
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:19,030
这里曾是渔港。
This was a fishing port.

6
00:00:19,070 --> 00:00:22,586
如今，海在 95 公里之外。
Today, the sea is 95 km away.

7
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:26,279
可在北边，修起了一道坝。
But up north, a dam went in.

8
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:28,995
水回来了。
And the water came back.

9
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:32,210
海不是自己回来的。
The sea did not come back on its own.

10
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,150
是有人把它留住了。
Someone kept it.
